<title>USA: High Plains Wheat - Basis firms on mill demand.</title>
<headline>High Plains Wheat - Basis firms on mill demand.</headline>
<dateline>KANSAS CITY, Mo. 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hard red winter wheat basis bids firmed Friday on continued mill demand, grain merchandisers in the High Plains said.</p>
<p>&quot;There's a little bit of mill demand still staying out there,&quot; one south central Kansas dealer said. &quot;The board's generally been lower this week, which of course has shut off farmer selling.&quot;</p>
<p>Grain dealers at one location in northern Oklahoma marveled at the lack of sales despite the fact that basis bids at their location were within two or three cents of bids at the Gulf of Mexico.  </p>
